{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3ae4016bdbac5e1e8f9154f1dd4eecef85e8f9ed3e9893fe0502cf9156d77525", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの発足に合わせ、雪歩も宣材写真を\n撮り直すことになった。今日はその撮影日だ）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，雪步的宣传照\n也要重拍。今天就是拍摄的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "257cf0038ae04a5881a28ba52cc5a90a74a6958aff744f32abad67855a380fdf", "ja": "宣材写真の撮影だなんて……。えへへ、\nアイドルになったばっかりの時を思い出しますねっ。", "zh": "居然要拍宣传照……嘿嘿，\n不禁让人想起刚成为偶像的日子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "836ea26688200717e36212cc8daaf7c44cea27bb872f0dfc9d1698f7f42e5124", "ja": "あの頃と違って、\n雪歩もいまは何度も撮影を経験してるんだ。", "zh": "雪步现在已经不同以往，\n也有了无数次的拍摄经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "79d644910fe8bb1a803d23ef9d54dce962f9f70f32b44db575ce3c1a277eafa2", "ja": "今日はその経験を活かして、\nいい写真を撮ってもらおうな。", "zh": "今天就要麻烦你活用过去的经验，\n拍一些好照片出来啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e271577ac7aef984ba2b5342d1f15ad5757b248ea7888503e7c984e7b8929c4d", "ja": "は、はい。久しぶりだからドキドキしますけど、\nでも……きっと大丈夫だって思います。", "zh": "好、好的。虽然很久没拍，现在有点紧张，\n不过……我没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "46a4c2d4f691a452ff7f67d24231ba374d2c262974ff8939b517bc2f8ff56fa9", "ja": "{$P$}の言う通り、\n前よりはきっと、いい写真が……撮れるかも……。", "zh": "应该能像{$P$}说的，\n拍出比以前更好、更棒的……照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "681b901993864d24a958ac76db8df8a8f7b2767e0eec7589727a3855e1981f3d", "ja": "なんて……私なんかがそんなこと言ったら、\nおこがましいですよね……？", "zh": "开玩笑的……我这种人还敢说大话，\n是不是很自不量力……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bf9ca98f13da8cd803864fb115505598566d5baa63c5e41ebd8251bd6b79f856", "ja": "いや全然。\nむしろ、その調子でいこう！", "zh": "怎么会呢，\n这样才好，你就这样上场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1b12e9397b323f61d5192b15e7f5dce48000150ecb31ae3c47a5cf859640cc30", "ja": "あ……、はいっ。ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}……。えへへっ♪", "zh": "啊……好的！谢谢你，\n{$P$}……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5d4b11322336b44e9b8c906970cea9779cf1a006c9e9ce4819b88dce7dfb9473", "ja": "ん？　急に笑ったりして、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？突然眉开眼笑的，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f3fe7ddd20e317d57d551e82910956d7de1cbbf4fc8b7d4cde0a1a269b73cecd", "ja": "ちょっと……思ったんです。", "zh": "我只是……在想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c6fe56e8650ae9fc6abbbdf85ad7182206f67ade0de3b31a6ec63d0c7d0a3ffc", "ja": "ダメダメな私が、今みたいに前向きになれるのは……\n{$P$}のおかげです。だから……", "zh": "不行不行的我，能变得像现在这么积极……\n全都是托{$P$}的福，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "066afaff3f2fd5fbeca518fc3c7ca61d0577de83972016d9a88914642bc7e878", "ja": "新しい人達も、{$P$}がいてくれる\nから、きっと大丈夫だって……。ですよね？", "zh": "新人们也会有{$P$}陪伴在旁，\n肯定不会有问题的……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6e09a559dfcc6b699723e2ad61df12bae962cc32a77870c2c512b33f582f1282", "ja": "はは、じつは俺も大丈夫だと思ってるんだ。\n何しろここに、頼りになる先輩がいるからな。", "zh": "哈哈，其实我也一点都不担心。\n因为这里就有可靠的前辈在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d8be3758ba593f7c10b75ffe48d79b4d05f2c03ea77054e80879ffbfa8a1dbc6", "ja": "た、頼りになる先輩？　どこにですか？\n……ここに？　……ええっ、私！？", "zh": "可、可靠的前辈？在哪呀？\n……这里？……咦咦！是在说我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8f43fcbd61a42ecd2ae9c4b1a8089baaad25ee14caffc6690044881dfd3c8329", "ja": "とととと、とんでもないですぅ！\nわ、私なんて、まだまだダメダメで……！", "zh": "不不不不、不敢当啊～！\n我、我这样，根本还很不行不行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4cd534266db011581cce2edf058024239ae02bb490cf9c8b4320599f44ab79f7", "ja": "ただ、みんなより、ちょっとだけ先に\n歩き始めたから……歩き方を少し知ってるだけで……。", "zh": "我只是比她们起步得早一些……\n所以稍微知道该怎么走而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9151cdf62a6105d5ccb80c927d053d4d2478c126e7f82689a4826aba53591173", "ja": "その雪歩が歩いた道のりが、\n後輩達にとって何よりの道しるべだ。", "zh": "雪步走过的路程，\n对新人们来说就是最明确的路标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "58fed2b07457e5762d0cead4f405cd85167053765ff8449f347e514883e4d542", "ja": "このまま先を歩き続けて、\nみんなに進むべき道を指し示してあげてくれ。", "zh": "希望你能继续走下去，\n指出她们未来该前进的方向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f001235f8231ef8b9a26bf2099c23091fd2415766f1c1825213891b0435510ee", "ja": "私が、みんなの進むための道を……。", "zh": "由我指引她们前进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1b08557dd58c277acbcb3c386961308885a0550b1a6f16956dbc0c2b3fd1fc51", "ja": "私の前に、これからどんな道があるかもわからない\nですし……正直、ちゃんと進めるか不安です……。", "zh": "我也不晓得今后会有什么在前方等着自己……\n老实说，我很担心自己有没有办法好好走下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "0e857528eb81cb26e6ccc38db63687e14027ef01089c59d7f299409c5aa55be4", "ja": "一歩一歩でいいんだ。\n雪歩なら大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "一步一步慢慢来就好。\n雪步肯定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b067ce685fc28bd68dc629ef22c4f424036996bc35345e2bd30bd7179a38f8c0", "ja": "で、でも、きっとたくさん迷ったり、立ち止まったり、\n来た道を戻ったりしちゃいそうですし……。", "zh": "可、可是，感觉我就会迷路、裹足不前，\n甚至沿原路折返……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0dbf03f4e0ad95dade2438a9870459761bf3b7ae903dd8e4941bd03cb7e46755", "ja": "だから……その時は{$P$}が、私を\nまっすぐ進ませてくださいね？　みんなのためにも。", "zh": "所以……到时候{$P$}要负起责任，\n帮助我笔直地向前走下去哦，这也是为了新人们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "750689bccce73f62497271a85937e121df5822fdc15f8df849ad67b394906f0b", "ja": "私も先輩として、その、できるかぎり……\n胸を張って、一歩ずつ進んで行きますから。", "zh": "我也会像个前辈，那个、尽可能地……\n抬头挺胸，一步一步向前迈进的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "41f4ed35be506b4678657682b054ce7ace6b5446d3d30a3e953bf3c339318588", "ja": "ああ、まかせてくれ。\nこれからも一緒に歩いて行こうな。", "zh": "好，交给我吧。\n今后也让我们一起走下去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "852954013e7b6d19a5f8f18b05db685aa06a5ea17f8d33bca6ed8dd0c556cf16", "ja": "は、はいぃっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "e38de483c8d6f2de5369ccf5987b239d58d5035538f6435ca7378df5943534a6", "ja": "（雪歩が進んだ道……その軌跡は、\n雪歩のスナップショットみたいなもの）", "zh": "（雪步走过的路程……\n这个轨迹，就犹如雪步留下的快照。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_002_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b6cffc92cdfb83a20646120ccc666b87e3d81d94aa2a0dd145b4a2b84e91fb12", "ja": "（今日の撮影は、雪歩にとって新たな1歩、\nアイドルとして成長した1枚になるだろう）", "zh": "（相信今天的拍摄，对雪步而言就是崭新的一步，\n作为偶像有所成长的一个见证吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
